Dezven Portfolio Website

A responsive personal portfolio website built using HTML, CSS, and Bootstrap 5.

The website includes a modern portfolio layout with sections for the hero area, about, skills, services, experience, portfolio projects, testimonials, and contact information.

🚀 Features

Responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile

Bootstrap 5 grid system

Custom CSS styling

Smooth scrolling

CSS hover effects and transitions

Animated buttons and cards

Responsive navigation menu using CSS

Hero section with profile image

About Me section

Skills and progress bars

Services section

Experience section

Portfolio/project cards

Testimonials section

Contact section

Footer section

No JavaScript required

🛠️ Technologies Used

HTML5

CSS3

Bootstrap 5

