💻 How to Run

Download or clone this repository.

Open the project folder.

Open index.html in your browser.

No installation or build process is required.

📱 Responsive Design

The website is designed to work across:

Desktop

Laptop

Tablet

Mobile

CSS media queries are used to adjust the layout, typography, images, navigation, cards, and spacing for different screen sizes.

🎨 Design

The website uses:

Clean white background

Red accent color

Modern typography

Rounded cards

Smooth hover transitions

Responsive Bootstrap layout

✨ Animations & Transitions

The website includes CSS-only effects such as:

Button hover animations

Card lift effects

Image zoom effects

Portfolio image overlays

Service icon rotation

Social icon rotation

Form focus effects

Navigation underline animation

Smooth scrolling

📌 Sections

Home

Introduction and hero section with a call-to-action button.

About

Personal introduction, skills, and working process.

Services

Services including design, development, responsiveness, testing, and database-related work.

Experience

Professional experience displayed using responsive cards.

Portfolio

Project showcase with images, descriptions, and categories.

Testimonials

Client/testimonial cards.

Contact

Contact information and contact form.

